# Testing Rules

When editing tests:

## Commands

Use the Makefile. Do not hallucinate ad-hoc commands:

- `make test-solver` — Engine/solver tests (pytest on engine/)
- `make calc-her` — Harmonic Error Rate (music21)
- `make eval-telemetry` — Repair Efficiency, survey analysis

## Conventions

- Run tests after each implementation chunk.
- Prefer deterministic, isolated tests. No flaky timing or external services unless required.
